cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FrIdéo — French News Outlet Ideology Scores"
message: "If you use these scores or the replication code, please cite the paper below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sobhy
    given-names: Amr
    affiliation: Le French News Lab
    email: amr@frenchnewslab.org
repository-code: "https://github.com/lefrenchnewslab/frideo"
abstract: >-
  A continuous ideology scale for thirty French national news outlets, built by
  fusing nine independent evidence families — ownership, hyperlink network,
  reader surveys, editorial charters, reference profiling, broadcast guest
  bookings, two rating panels, and a distancing-aware lexical measure of the
  outlets' own articles. Each outlet carries a position, a confidence interval,
  and every input published.
keywords:
  - media ideology
  - French news
  - evidence fusion
  - computational journalism
  - political communication
